From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 18:10:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm: dts: expose Aurora ABL linear scanout to EFI

Android 14 OS1.0.3.0.UNACNXM ABL leaves VIG0/VIG1 reading two 720x3200
halves of the same 1440x3200 buffer at 0xfc400000. Both report stride
0x1680, SRC_FORMAT 0x237ff and unpack 0x03020001: linear ARGB8888.
Use the measured scanout, retaining the original splash reservation.
No display clocks, DSI registers or panel power sequence are changed.
Register interpretation follows Linux dpu_hw_sspp.c and mdp_format.c:
https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/tree/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_hw_sspp.c?h=v7.3-rc5

Signed-off-by: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
---
diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/sm8650-xiaomi-aurora-u-boot.dtsi b/arch/arm/dts/sm8650-xiaomi-aurora-u-boot.dtsi
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/sm8650-xiaomi-aurora-u-boot.dtsi
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+
+/ {
+	chosen {
+		#address-cells = <2>;
+		#size-cells = <2>;
+		ranges;
+
+		framebuffer@fc400000 {
+			compatible = "simple-framebuffer";
+			reg = <0 0xfc400000 0 0x1194000>;
+			width = <1440>;
+			height = <3200>;
+			stride = <5760>;
+			format = "a8r8g8b8";
+			status = "okay";
+		};
+	};
+};
